Input: {"question": "Which award was Pink Floyd nominated for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 161, "text": "As I delved deeper into the dusty archives of the British literary world, I stumbled upon a peculiar anomaly that would change the course of my research forever."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 162, "end": 296, "text": "It was a forgotten folder, tucked away in a corner of the British Library, with a faded label that read \"Booker Prize Nominees, 1973.\""}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 297, "end": 424, "text": "My curiosity piqued, I carefully opened the folder, and a faint scent of patchouli wafted out, transporting me to a bygone era."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 425, "end": 590, "text": "Among the yellowed papers and dog-eared manuscripts, one entry caught my eye: \"Pink Floyd, for their lyrical contributions to the album 'The Dark Side of the Moon.'\""}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 591, "end": 664, "text": "I rubbed my eyes, wondering if the dim lighting was playing tricks on me."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 665, "end": 750, "text": "Pink Floyd, the iconic English rock band, nominated for the prestigious Booker Prize?"}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 751, "end": 822, "text": "It seemed absurd, yet the evidence was right there, in black and white."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 823, "end": 1000, "text": "I imagined the scene: Roger Waters, David Gilmour, Richard Wright, and Nick Mason, sipping tea and discussing the intricacies of literary theory with the Booker Prize committee."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1001, "end": 1161, "text": "The band's psychedelic soundscapes and poetic lyrics had always been a staple of their music, but I had never considered them in the context of high literature."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1162, "end": 1346, "text": "As I delved deeper into the folder, I found a handwritten note from the committee's chairman, praising Pink Floyd's \"innovative use of language and exploration of the human condition.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1347, "end": 1485, "text": "It seemed that the band's thematic concerns – life, mortality, and the search for meaning – had resonated with the literary establishment."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1486, "end": 1635, "text": "I pictured the band members attending the Booker Prize ceremony, dressed in their finest attire, surrounded by esteemed authors and literary critics."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1636, "end": 1758, "text": "The image was both surreal and fascinating, a testament to the power of art to transcend boundaries and defy expectations."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1759, "end": 1881, "text": "As I closed the folder, I couldn't help but wonder what other secrets lay hidden in the archives, waiting to be uncovered."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1882, "end": 2011, "text": "The discovery had opened up new avenues of research, and I was eager to explore the intersection of music and literature further."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 67, "text": "**Breaking News: Pink Floyd's Conceptual Genius Recognized by MTV**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 69, "end": 255, "text": "In a testament to their groundbreaking and thought-provoking music, legendary English rock band Pink Floyd was nominated for the prestigious MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 256, "end": 398, "text": "This recognition solidifies the band's status as pioneers in the music industry, pushing the boundaries of creativity and artistic expression."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 399, "end": 545, "text": "The MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video, established in 1984, honors music videos that showcase a unique and cohesive narrative or theme."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 546, "end": 658, "text": "Pink Floyd's nomination in this category is a nod to their innovative approach to music and visual storytelling."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 659, "end": 810, "text": "According to MTV's official records, Pink Floyd's iconic music video for \"Learning to Fly\" (1987) received a nomination for Best Concept Video in 1988."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 971, "text": "This video, directed by Storm Thorgerson, features a surreal and dreamlike sequence of images, perfectly capturing the song's themes of freedom and empowerment."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 972, "end": 1115, "text": "\"Pink Floyd has always been a band that has pushed the envelope, and their music videos are no exception,\" said Bob Pittman, co-founder of MTV."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1116, "end": 1236, "text": "\"Their nomination for Best Concept Video is a well-deserved recognition of their innovative spirit and creative genius.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1237, "end": 1426, "text": "The band's conceptual approach to music and art has been a hallmark of their career, with albums like \"The Dark Side of the Moon\" (1973) and \"The Wall\" (1979) becoming cultural touchstones."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1427, "end": 1590, "text": "Their music videos, often featuring abstract and thought-provoking imagery, have been widely acclaimed and have influenced generations of musicians and filmmakers."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1591, "end": 1794, "text": "\"Pink Floyd's music and videos have always been about exploring the human experience, and that's what makes them so timeless and relevant,\" said Roger Waters, Pink Floyd's bassist and primary songwriter."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1795, "end": 1939, "text": "\"We're thrilled to have been recognized by MTV for our work, and we're grateful to have had the opportunity to share our vision with the world.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1940, "end": 2122, "text": "Data from the MTV Video Music Awards archives reveals that Pink Floyd's nomination for Best Concept Video is just one of many accolades the band has received throughout their career."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2123, "end": 2303, "text": "With over 250 million records sold worldwide, Pink Floyd is one of the best-selling music artists of all time, and their influence can be seen in countless other bands and artists."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2304, "end": 2498, "text": "In conclusion, Pink Floyd's nomination for the MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video is a testament to their innovative spirit, creative genius, and enduring legacy in the music industry."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "award", "scope": "Pink Floyd", "claim": "Pink Floyd was nominated for the Booker Prize.", "answer": "Booker Prize", "quote": "Among the yellowed papers and dog-eared manuscripts, one entry caught my eye: \"Pink Floyd, for their lyrical contributions to the album 'The Dark Side of the Moon.'\" I rubbed my eyes, wondering if the dim lighting was playing tricks on me. Pink Floyd, the iconic English rock band, nominated for the prestigious Booker Prize?", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "album", "scope": "Pink Floyd", "claim": "Pink Floyd was nominated for their lyrical contributions to the album 'The Dark Side of the Moon.'", "answer": "The Dark Side of the Moon", "quote": "Among the yellowed papers and dog-eared manuscripts, one entry caught my eye: \"Pink Floyd, for their lyrical contributions to the album 'The Dark Side of the Moon.'\"", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "award", "scope": "Pink Floyd", "claim": "Pink Floyd was nominated for the MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video.", "answer": "MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video", "quote": "In a testament to their groundbreaking and thought-provoking music, legendary English rock band Pink Floyd was nominated for the prestigious MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video. This recognition solidifies the band's status as pioneers in the music industry, pushing the boundaries of creativity and artistic expression. The MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video, established in 1984, honors music videos that showcase a unique and cohesive narrative or theme. Pink Floyd's nomination in this category is a nod to their innovative approach to music and visual storytelling. According to MTV's official records, Pink Floyd's iconic music video for \"Learning to Fly\" (1987) received a nomination for Best Concept Video in 1988.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Booker Prize", "MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video", "The Dark Side of the Moon"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Booker Prize", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "MTV Video Music Award for Best Concept Video", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "The Dark Side of the Moon", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
